From 0027000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: minhtritt1996 <minhtritt1996@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 05:46:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: enable SMP 4 cores, GICv3 redistributor walk and software SPI IPI

Configure GICv3 redistributor discovery, fix IROUTER affinity mapping,
and implement software SPI IPI routes for secondary core wakeups.
Also fix PSCI isb argument and register GenericARMPE before secondary boot.
---
